### 📋 Troubleshooting Checklist
| Issue | Likely Root Cause | Fix |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| *Node is Offline* | Network drop or service stopped. | Re-run the connection command in cmd. |
| *"Access Denied"* | Folder permission issues. | Right-click cmd $\rightarrow$ *Run as Administrator*. |
| *Build stuck in Queue* | No agent matches the label. | Check *Manage Jenkins* $\rightarrow$ *Nodes* to ensure the label matches exactly. |
| *Java Version Mismatch* | Controller and Agent use different JDKs. | Ensure both machines have the exact same minor version of Java installed. |
